  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creative Skills Camp &quot;Another World&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through immersive media and tech leadership training camps, the program will provide young people with an opportunity to develop critical thinking skills, resilience and leadership skills, and to use technology to counter notions of an &quot;us vs them&quot; world, allowing the most geographically isolated students to participate in transformative global conversations for peace and tolerance.</narrative>
